 983:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdmarker.c ****  *
 984:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdmarker.c ****  * Returns same codes as are defined for jpeg_consume_input:
 985:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdmarker.c ****  * JPEG_SUSPENDED, JPEG_REACHED_SOS, or JPEG_REACHED_EOI.
 986:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdmarker.c ****  *
 987:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdmarker.c ****  * Note: This function may return a pseudo SOS marker (with zero
 988:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdmarker.c ****  * component number) for treat by input controller's consume_input.
 989:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdmarker.c ****  * consume_input itself should filter out (skip) the pseudo marker
 990:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdmarker.c ****  * after processing for the caller.
